# Route: guide 11 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 32 to
# 34, 63 quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stormwind City, Thousand Needles, Ironforge, Wetlands): near Stormwind
# City -> Stormwind City -> near Stormwind City -> Stormwind -> near Stormwind
# -> Stormwind City -> near Stormwind City -> near Stormwind -> near Stormwind
# City -> The Shimmering Flats -> The Great Lift -> near Stormwind City ->
# near Stormwind -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Oh Brother... (167; Foreman
# Thistlenettle 20); Collecting Memories (168; Skeletal Miner 17-18, Undead
# Excavator 17-18, Undead Dynamiter 17-18); Encrusted Tail Fins (1107;
# Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale Tide Lord 37,
# Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); A Host of Evil (6626;
# Razorfen Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist
# 33-34); The Dark Iron War (303; Dark Iron Dwarf 27-28, Dark Iron Tunneler
# 29-30, Dark Iron Saboteur 28-29, Dark Iron Demolitionist 30-31); A Grim Task
# (304; Balgaras the Foul 34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2758 The
# Origins of Smithing; 2759 In Search of Galvan; 3630 Gnome Engineering; 4181
# Goblin Engineering; 7497 The Journey Has Just Begun; 5143 Tribal
# Leatherworking; 1578 Supplying the Front; 1618 Gearing Redridge; 3629 Goblin
# Engineering; 3632 Gnome Engineering; 3640 The Pledge of Secrecy; 3641 Show
# Your Work; 3647 Membership Card Renewal; 5283 The Art of the Armorsmith;
# 5284 The Way of the Weaponsmith; 6609 I Got Nothin' Left!; 6612 I Know A
# Guy...; 6625 Alliance Trauma; 96045 Camping 101: Alchemy; 96059 Camping 101:
# Enchanting.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Quell The Uprising (387), Quell the Uprising (387), The
# Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood (388), The Stockade Riots (391),
# The Stockade Riots (391), Underground Assault (2040), Underground Assault
# (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green Sample (92456), A Green Sample
# (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power Overwhelming (92489), The Crone
# of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770), Knowledge in the Deeps (971),
# Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of
# the Titans (1050), The Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200),
# Restoring the Necklace (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential
# Artificials (2924), Essential Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929),
